# MCP and cross-surface parity

When Amprealize MCP tools are available, prefer them over ad-hoc duplication so schemas and telemetry stay aligned.

For features exposed on multiple surfaces (CLI, REST, MCP, web), follow shared contracts and add or extend parity tests when the codebase already uses that pattern.

Details: [`docs/contracts/`](../../docs/contracts/) and behavior **`behavior_validate_cross_surface_parity`** in [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).
